2026-11-06T02:57:37.7818134Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T02:57:37.7818524Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T02:57:37.7819058Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T02:57:37.7819480Z    /root
2026-11-06T02:57:37.7830819Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T02:57:37.7831585Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T02:57:37.7841255Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T02:57:37.7841953Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T02:57:37.7842332Z 
